/*@meta

Author:
'Sound Dust'

Description:
'A complex mess of bees'

Usage:
'MW find the queen\r\nAT Attack!'

Categories:
'Pads:Atonal, Pads:Breathy, Pads:Distorted, Pads:Drones, Pads:Evolving'

